  IconPath: icons/magic/nature/symbol-moon-stars-white.webp
  Description: You were born with a spark of magic that could set you on the path
    to becoming a Greenspeaker or Faithspeaker. Select divine or primal. If you selected
    divine, you're a Faithspeaker. If you selected primal, you're a Greenspeaker.
    This choice can't be changed. You gain one cantrip from the chosen spell list.
    You can cast this spell as an innate spell at will. A cantrip is heightened to
    a spell rank equal to half your level rounded up.
